      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ab9f11b9edda6f06fb0257ba73367159",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "问题是，当年的皇家网球场，长短并不统一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f26525a615e4dddb87d1bb3217ce228e4de0764e14d37939c5a9c2cf742d20a8",
      "words_sha256": "65eb9df3f933ccfcbc2b57ebee5433d6297e64313b2577ada51f01cac9a08cf6",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e3cb3a8d6a5f7836ae862ab5007967b0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两种说法都有漏洞。网球史学者争了几百年，至今没有定论。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "47b7021de7f6f3d37087728bf8693b41fabb61938214dbee7d21f08a9867868d",
      "words_sha256": "0ed620acc18afdb6ecbcc8837042b25ebe4ac3fe2ba240da2ca908720a55eac3",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ae57842e557e5c3b2131d8a1f84b097e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那四十五，又是怎么变成四十的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ed1966157ecc885d0235912110009311c04b148ab660e90bdb32a7b8ccbe7915",
      "words_sha256": "9982aee2a9e0ddec72a9c5a9839379909f695961a19dce3292f8af395a44f542",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2738d408fe937203e8c604159e103938",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "钟面说的解释是，给平分留出位置：四十、五十、六十。也有人说，四十只是更好念。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "96bc3356be6ab2131efad955ec1fc6cd0ade72c5d772909e8479651a9517be1c",
      "words_sha256": "feb4628f0db3f70648a2c2d9aa96009df76b23ab468db330aaa2774196766b32",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c166333a245105f8af66fa36772497e1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "哪一种，都拿不出原始证据。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "df2e42533fe157b68e52476e2c4bf0d38086cb4dc7d9fc6d569649921b7fd810",
      "words_sha256": "96cf8864bf702e0456f1ed79f53930adf15b5a1daa2cbe30dbcadb91ad9ce20b",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4f46b6778c16419ee2546942fe8ed7dc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "能确定的是，一八七七年第一届温网规则写明：沿用皇家网球的计分，十五、三十、四十。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "734ab23f052bdb045e0bb85e818a1f937df314a50314f1871becc526f5351d0e",
      "words_sha256": "e7fd9e37d361100a7a9fe2e505456fe66a8b783a73e2cb38c03e46ba131486de",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "690c0a5320ca62cc40359ae5146ece53",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再说 love。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5e6582c0da789b26f39ea16ec566a50742d4d83615f3b88c78bd20482790ceef",
      "words_sha256": "326f7c8aabb0469466caecc9d5a0acf1d326ae610bc1974f99416a3a111b1f4b",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e31c7c89e3d1eea6499be857c553403",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最浪漫的说法，是法语里的鸡蛋，因为零的形状像个蛋。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f3930a7a1e8bb6c41d6f77000cc033c69ff41788ae3c3132bc3432a7def2e29a",
      "words_sha256": "01d67b629761e14e66b9595ff43f4c92952b8149c8bf944202eb2327cc70568b",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f22a1baabf2ba2dc5af1d652cee1d90",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可韦氏词典的词源学家说，找不到法语用鸡蛋表示零分的任何证据。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "13f84148291ff5d179a276c6290b0ad65c60e0e83584d7c076d020e478f4e97c",
      "words_sha256": "c929f9faafdc32503ef524dc2c117bf15b3c752c5e500df404c7bdaa4f212a47",
      "words_path": "voice_25.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "015171382791173f25ffcd0bafc3b968",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "还有人说来自荷兰语，意思是荣誉：为荣誉而打，不为钱。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "18bec2601c1fae878a7bd1d6a953be4bdff2638db301db3bee839df0fdab3e60",
      "words_sha256": "827ee2fb4b29d43e12df77c51d29e2bca2ca0f48e7c5d8e7006d43c1168ec200",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "30f9506fbf18d0af240acb5f640910ff",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "词源学家更认可的，是英语里的为爱而玩：不下注，白打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "961322d7bf393158554beded49352a0a9d98676706fa07e74a1ca7511dd99213",
      "words_sha256": "340b81b3f207f3c376608b991ae3ea5670d5f01bf1e4f728b9b7991b8b971b9a",
      "words_path": "voice_27.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d2194d5e0827126876e31c28c511cb58",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这个说法十七世纪就有了。到一七四二年，love 已经用来表示零分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bc284ac7c8929a27aae7d2e8d34a0e618203f7cf60959ef67934deb3c4c0f9de",
      "words_sha256": "db3ea00f4c56b1ef8a5ac81a2701732e197936f038250e70ce1347101b34fb52",
      "words_path": "voice_28.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "872679d5c16454bfeec19f92b2294458",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巧的是，公爵那首诗里写的，正是押了注，不是白打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4005bd13433bc7fc51121a6b6708a4994a1192326f3ece7a2f74a1d2a3df90a2",
      "words_sha256": "f3462bf18cd42d07f4fdf00e2a2a7928a379f7585bc49642eb91119f32567ced",
      "words_path": "voice_29.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1acae10bb6bb22ee37d14da6fd956f9c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "嫌绕口？美国网协的规则手册写着：可以用零、一、二、三，代替 love、十五、三十、四十。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c683ca841c265cf0c2ddd87d4b4a231bc28f6c09773865bbac92deac68c6617e",
      "words_sha256": "daabf0e0fa462be1cad4579765950cb6530906212f20b9ec3030cd324a00cc96",
      "words_path": "voice_30.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d50f3dfb81eac56dcf4a70535d0673cf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "国际网联的规则里没有这一条。大满贯赛场上，主裁照样喊 love。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d7c11273135ad567c72e6a9aed19c9defe5d243d549854ebeafeea1ff3ccb501",
      "words_sha256": "fa9511e8d25b26e46f4f9d7c01759f25a2276c39bf4ca1f7238aafb42c698b3a",
      "words_path": "voice_31.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7073d5ae3ee9f970a8959244a65c66b3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六百年，来历说不清，规矩却一直没改。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "db9753a2d4789cd1dd5a5e46f9973d8a030881418a84dd0e568e0ef84030a0b7",
      "words_sha256": "fabd811bc240837257765ea76508d222667d8ced54cf47617827015c78d26a33",
      "words_path": "voice_32.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c8845bcca7b8cc73dbda3b38bb3dfe9c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十五、三十、四十，再加一个 love。如果让你改成一、二、三、四，你同意吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7814101ae535a6a616bc7da71844d9e423414e671b1b32a03ed2da616bedbc5d",
      "words_sha256": "0fcec2e90d0fe7d2d2027ea0010cb061fe96a4a2ee349eea169bb315300ea992",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fe3dc7abdaac9a8c4b3140dbfbf2eaf3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十五、三十、四十，为什么没有四十五？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1b5ce34e24b37fade1b8536e2abc774e97293779e6b34fa52b02023b711ab339",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
